  "prefLabel": "Emp 406.03 Claim For Benefits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 406.03 Claim For Benefits. A claim for a week of benefits by an \"eligible claimant\" shall be deemed to be a claim for emergency unemployment compensation, not regular compensation, until the exhaustion of all emergency unemployment compensation payable with respect to the benefit year referred to in Emp 406.02(a).\n\nSource. #9761, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-26-10, EXPIRED: 1-24-11",
